  "restore-all-archived-migration": "vuyisela hinkwavo hlayisiwile",
  "restore-all-archived-migration-description": "Yi vuyisa tindlela, minxaxamelo na makhadi hinkwaswo leswi nga eka vuhlayiselo bya swa khale. Hi xoxe yi lulamisa swimlaneId kumbe listId leyi pfumalekaka leswaku swilo swi vonaka.",
